Comment: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:53.99,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}吐く息の鼓動から感じるよ
Comment: 0,0:21:53.99,0:21:56.67,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}あたたかいな
Comment: 0,0:21:56.67,0:22:06.59,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}大切な日常が　ここにあるの
Comment: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:20.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}ねえ　寄り添うことで　伝えようとした
Comment: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:26.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}不器用なとこ　好きだよ
Comment: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:33.47,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}私今きっと幸せだよ
Comment: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:41.00,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}誰も知りえない　運命のかごの中で
Comment: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:43.69,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:48.09,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑って少し泣いて
Comment: 0,0:22:48.09,0:22:51.83,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}私のいる意味が
Comment: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:58.62,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}君の手で生まれかえられていく
Comment: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:04.25,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}ほら、ほら　ね？
Comment: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:12.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}大好き
Comment: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:15.64,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}大好き
Comment: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:19.85,EDJP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,550)\blur1\c&HD081FF&}大好き
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDCN-------------------
Comment: 0,0:21:45.58,0:21:53.99,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}能从你呼吸的律动感觉得到哦
Comment: 0,0:21:53.99,0:21:56.67,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}真是温暖啊
Comment: 0,0:21:56.67,0:22:06.59,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}珍惜的日常生活就在这里
Comment: 0,0:22:13.65,0:22:20.80,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}你知道吗  你试图借由依偎传达心意
Comment: 0,0:22:20.80,0:22:26.51,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}你笨拙的那点  我很喜欢哦
Comment: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:33.47,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}我现在一定很幸福
Comment: 0,0:22:34.04,0:22:41.00,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,0)\blur1}在谁也无法知晓的命运牢笼中
Comment: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:43.69,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}Behind you
Comment: 0,0:22:43.69,0:22:48.09,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}笑着并稍微落泪
Comment: 0,0:22:48.09,0:22:51.83,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}我的存在意义
Comment: 0,0:22:51.83,0:22:58.62,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(0,350)\blur1}将由你的双手重新塑造
Comment: 0,0:23:00.51,0:23:04.25,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\fad(250,350)\blur1}你看  你看  对吧？
Comment: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:12.11,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1}最喜欢你了
Comment: 0,0:23:12.11,0:23:15.64,EDCN,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur1\c&H5AB5F4&}最喜欢你了
